  "fullDescription": "Bring the beauty of nature into your creative projects with Bohemian Greenery – Watercolor Tropical Leaves Digital Paper Collection.\n\nThis refreshing collection features elegant watercolor foliage, lush monstera leaves, eucalyptus sprigs, tropical greenery, and botanical accents in soothing shades of sage, emerald, eucalyptus, and soft forest green. Designed with a clean bohemian aesthetic, these papers offer a perfect blend of modern simplicity and natural charm.\n\nWhether you’re creating scrapbook layouts, junk journals, planner pages, invitations, stickers, cards, or printable décor, these versatile botanical backgrounds provide a timeless and calming backdrop for your designs.\n\n🌿 Collection Features:\n53 high-quality digital papers\n300 DPI resolution for crisp printing\nWatercolor tropical leaves and botanical illustrations\nSoft bohemian-inspired greenery palette\nSeamless coordinating backgrounds\nInstant digital download\n🍃 Perfect For:\nScrapbooking\nJunk journals\nPlanner pages\nCard making\nInvitations\nStickers\nPrintable wall art\nHome décor projects\nWedding stationery\nBotanical crafts\nDigital design projects\nDIY gifts\n\nFilled with lush greenery, watercolor foliage, and modern boho elegance, this collection is ideal for nature lovers, botanical enthusiasts, and creatives seeking fresh, organic inspiration.",
